<title>USA: Synovus Financial names Prescott CFO.</title>
<headline>Synovus Financial names Prescott CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, GA. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Synovus Financial Corp said it named Thomas Prescott chief financial officer to replace Stephen Burts, who has assumed more supervisory responsibilities at the company's affiliates.</p>
<p>The moves come as the company prepares for the retirement of Joe Beverly, it said, who retires December 31.</p>
<p>Beverly is vice chairman of the company. He will be replaced by Walter Deriso, who had been president of one of the company's affiliates, the company said.</p>
